# packaging/openbsd/x11/bitty/distinfo
#
# Real SHA256 and size entries cannot be computed before the v0.0.31 tag is
# created, because `make makesum` fetches the released source tarball and
# every vendored crate from GitHub/crates.io.
#
# Tag-time procedure (from a ports tree checkout with bitty copied in):
#   cd /usr/ports/x11/bitty
#   make makesum
#   cp distinfo /path/to/bitty/packaging/openbsd/x11/bitty/distinfo
#
# Distfiles required once tagged:
#   v0.0.31.tar.gz
